{"ref":"BDB, בְּתוּאֵל","hw":"בְּתוּאֵל","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בְּתוּאֵל</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong>? = <span dir=\"rtl\">מְתוּאֵל</span> <em>man of God</em><strong>)</strong> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 22:22\" href=\"/Genesis.22.22\">Gn 22:22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 22:23\" href=\"/Genesis.22.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:15\" href=\"/Genesis.24.15\">24:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:24\" href=\"/Genesis.24.24\">24</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:47\" href=\"/Genesis.24.47\">47</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:50\" href=\"/Genesis.24.50\">50</a> (J) son of Nahor, neph. of Abr., living in Aramaic-Naharaim, in city of Nahor; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:20\" href=\"/Genesis.25.20\">25:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 28:2\" href=\"/Genesis.28.2\">28:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 28:5\" href=\"/Genesis.28.5\">5</a> (P) Aramaean of Paddan-Aramaic.","next":"BDB, בְּתוּאֵל²","prev":"BDB, בַּת³"}